Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:39.58,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1490,872,1510,886,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:39.98,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(960,1038)}Eleventh Planet of the Solar System
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:13.16,def2,LEDROUS,0,0,0,,Commander Hijikata, the ships,\N equipment, and personnel are finally ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.64,0:02:16.74,def2,LEDROUS,0,0,0,,I want you to send them out\N for exploration as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:28.16,def2,SANTA,0,0,0,,That’s a pretty well-grown tree, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.16,0:02:29.00,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:32.54,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Here you go, Mr. Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.54,0:02:35.30,def2,KID,0,0,0,,Awesome !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:39.00,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,No fun without a Christmas tree, don’t you think so ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:42.62,def2,SANTA,0,0,0,,I owe you as always, Commander Saito.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:49.56,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,That old man was severely injured in the\N war against Garmillas, and lost his family, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.56,0:02:53.18,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,That’s why playing with those kids is all he lives for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:55.92,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I hope the tree will add an extra touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:56.74,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Hmmm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:02:58.88,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What’s wrong, Nagakura ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:02.66,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Building a good relationship\N with the people at a post is…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:11.42,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Never seen a looker like her on base.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.86,0:03:13.78,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,She may have arrived on the morning flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:20.83,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,I know how you feel, but please wait until \Nthe inspection is over, Professor Redrowz.{Ledrous.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.83,0:03:22.18,def2,LEDROUS,0,0,0,,But that won’t…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:26.40,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,It's{ the} regulations. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:29.30,def2,LEDROUS,0,0,0,,Wait, Commander Hijikata !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:35.63,def2,LEDROUS,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:38.68,def2,LEDROUS,0,0,0,,He ignored the directive{referral} from the Chief of Staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:38.83,mactitle,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz19.8\move(1170,718,782,620,31,3493)}…Ancient Archelias{ous} Ruins…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:44.38,def2,LEDROUS,0,0,0,,I guess that stubborn commander wants to\N stay on this remote planet for the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:50.16,def2,LEDROUS,0,0,0,,When can I investigate the planet \Nwhere the ancient Archelias{ous} ruins remain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:06.48,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,So, that’s the outermost planet of this system ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:11.66,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It strays from the common planetary\N plane because of its unique orbit…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:15.70,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,…but an artificial sun ensures the planet’s biological activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:18.78,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Then, we will ensure something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.23,0:04:21.96,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The usual measures have been taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:25.98,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,The name of the planet is Telezart…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.44,0:04:31.10,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,…a legendary planet whose \Ncivilization has developed to its peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:39.46,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,The people of the planet benefited from their\N ability to convert human will into a physical force.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:47.64,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Just like human imagination is limitless,\N the energy from the human soul is infinite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:54.84,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,With unlimited power, they could alter the \Nshape of a constellation if they chose to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:05:02.40,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Eventually, they transcended their physical bodies, \Nand became mental entities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.44,0:05:15.00,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Then they merged into a single life form\N in a dimension beyond{so far for} human{s to} reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:26.52,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Her name is Teresa, a goddess who resides between this world and the next,{after world,} desiring{wishing for} peace for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:32.38,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Kodai, this is no fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:38.40,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Various interstellar civilizations have literature which proves the existence of Telezart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:43.08,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,All of them more than a thousand years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.28,0:05:46.98,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,...including the records of those who were called by Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:48.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Called ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:55.30,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Kodai, the former crew of the \NYamato saw a common vision…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:00.35,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,…a vision of the deceased who were close to the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:03.18,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,They’re the messengers of Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:06.23,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Kodai, get on board the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:15.98,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Teresa has the insight of space from the beginning to its end, \Nbecause she exists in a higher dimension than ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:22.85,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{Teresa ni}Those who’re called by Teresa must fulfill \Ntheir duty according to a predetermined fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:46.64,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Doctor…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.23,0:06:47.94,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Hmmm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:52.19,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,…who am I ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:07:01.36,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Are you worried because you're the\N only one who didn't see a vision ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:09.25,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,I’ve heard a rumor about Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:11.62,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I’m sure he’s safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:14.54,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,That’s more like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:19.09,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,It doesn’t matter who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.57,0:07:22.74,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,We know you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:28.53,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,You have no doubts when\N it comes to believing in Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:30.63,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,That’s who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:31.38,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:34.94,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.91,0:07:41.98,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Who did you see, Doctor ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:46.32,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Their ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:55.52,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Many civilizations have dispatched expeditions,{exploration groups,} but no one has found the planet Telezart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:08:01.40,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,They say the planet itself\N must be sealed off somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:04.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Those coordinates…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.18,0:08:08.80,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,They match the direction of the energy\N wave which made us see the vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.14,0:08:12.96,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Right. You took it as an SOS signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:17.34,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Recently, Gatlantis has been \Nactive in that sector of space.{space zone.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.00,0:08:19.44,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Gatlantis ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:22.58,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,We know little about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:29.36,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,It’s a powerful military nation, but we don’t \Neven know where their home planet is located.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:35.26,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,If Gatlantis has broken the seal of Telezart…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:41.76,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,If so, why is Gatlantis targeting Telezart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:47.82,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,If you can break the seal and obtain the power of Teresa, you can do anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:50.38,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{iitsutae}…so the legend says.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:53.76,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,It’s probably not a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:09:00.12,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,If Teresa is an entity of a higher order,\N she must have the power to do anything in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.12,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,But that’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:04.83,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,…just speculation, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:08.68,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,But the fact that the Yamato's\N crew has been chosen is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:09.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Chosen ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:14.26,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,It’s not Earth, nor Garmillas, it's your crew.{ guys.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:19.62,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,If so, I think I know the reason why.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:25.63,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Keyman, take him to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:27.70,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,You know where, don’t you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:28.24,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:29.98,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:34.28,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,...witness the truth of Earth with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:50.73,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(972,1032)}Restricted Area Somewhere on Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:03.00,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What...is that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:14.63,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,It’s going to be a 1-hour tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:16.80,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Your body won't be able to \Nwithstand more than that.{any longer than that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.92,0:10:22.80,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:31.24,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Some say this place suffers from Reverse Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:32.96,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Reverse…?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:38.08,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,This planet was devastated \Nby Garmillas meteorite bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:39.82,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,So how was it restored ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:42.66,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,By the Cosmo Reverse…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:49.98,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Unknown technology tends to have\N side effects, but this is beyond ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:11:02.04,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,A human can't even withstand \Nten minutes without these scale cylinders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.18,0:11:19.34,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,T...that’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:28.24,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Where are we ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:34.88,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,This is the dark side of Earth, \Nhidden behind its beautifully restored nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:39.30,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,It’s a singularity created by the Cosmo Reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:51.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,How…?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:54.34,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,How could this have happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:12:00.78,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,It took five years to understand \Nthe nature of the Reverse Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:02.78,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{dock}Ten years to build the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:06.98,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,"Time Fault…"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:11.08,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That’s what it’s called by those who know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.18,0:12:14.22,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Time Fault…?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:20.84,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,One day outside equals ten days here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:32.32,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Cosmo Reverse created this anti-gravity singularity, which has distorted time inside this cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:39.40,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,This massive military factory took 30 years \Nto construct, while only three years passed outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:45.86,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,You must have wondered how the \NAndromeda was constructed so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:53.60,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Without this place, a fleet of ships with wave motion guns and the restoration of Earth would not have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:56.56,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Restoration ?! \NYou can't call this restoration !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:03.23,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The joint fleet and military alliance…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:05.92,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The problem isn't {just }yours alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:11.14,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Those are Garmillas ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.30,0:13:17.52,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The Earth government sold the usage\N rights of the Time Fault to Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:18.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,"Sold"…?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:23.64,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,In exchange for several colony planets that \Nwe haven’t figured out how to make use of…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:27.54,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{tairyo no}…including its abundant resources,\N and the colonists who live there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.74,0:13:35.32,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Garmillas can't continue its expansion,\N while Earth steers a course to greater strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:42.88,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The true meaning of the words “politics” and “economy” is shared throughout{ common across} the universe, isn't it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:49.14,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{This} Is this the future the Yamato \Nand its difficult journey {has }created ?{brought ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:56.48,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Promise me to never repeat our folly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:13:59.16,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:11.30,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai’s back from the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:16.20,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,Do you mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:22.48,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Yeah, he now knows about the Time Fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:30.44,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I knew this could happen when he went \Nto see a high-ranking Garmillas official.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:35.88,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Earth will continue building a \Nfleet of wave motion gun vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.28,0:14:38.02,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,That's the reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.62,0:14:44.13,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Commander, I’m very sorry for this outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:47.54,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Only because you stood up for us…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:53.90,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,I must go, but you have to hold your ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.78,0:15:08.86,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Now that Hijikata has been forced out,\N even if we don’t make a move, someone will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:10.06,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,If so…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.06,0:15:11.00,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,If so…?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:15.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,If so, what ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:27.48,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I'll re-install the wave motion gun on the Yamato myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.36,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Kodai, don’t !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:31.82,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:38.88,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Kodai, let me get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:42.23,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,I can't authorize your expedition to Telezart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:45.63,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Why not, Chief ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:48.16,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Are you going to ignore the call for help ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:55.03,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Chief, could you say the same to Captain Okita ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:16:02.33,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to protect ?\N What about the promise to Iscandar ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:04.82,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Building such a large-scale wave \Nmotion fleet by using the Time Fault…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.82,0:16:06.68,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Such a thing doesn't exist !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:13.18,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Whatever you saw, \Nthis decision can't be overturned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:14.40,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,You're dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.74,0:16:30.50,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:37.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Mr. Sanada, what was our journey for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:41.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Where is the Earth we wanted to restore ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:45.74,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{nanka}I feel like I’m going to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:49.04,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:17:00.06,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:03.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Sorry for not contacting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.14,0:17:08.96,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,We've all verified the Time Fault data Mr. Sanada sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:11.22,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,When did you get this information ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:19.48,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Hijikata told us to stay in the\N heart of this matter when he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.02,0:17:25.90,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I accepted the offer of refitting the Yamato\N in order to gather as much information as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:33.54,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{daga}Although we’ve discovered the existence of the \NTime Fault, we can’t change the course of the tide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:39.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,In the end, we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.94,0:17:42.14,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What do you mean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:48.64,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,All of the Yamato's crew have \Nbeen reassigned{is repositioned} as of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.74,0:17:52.86,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\N It's not because of your complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:58.28,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,The brass will never understand how we feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.12,0:18:10.36,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Earth was supposed to have been saved \Nby our great journey three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:13.20,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,But today's Earth is…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:14.88,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,This can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:24.30,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Those who are no longer with \Nus had something to say to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:30.02,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,A calamity is about to happen somewhere in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:35.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,There are no words to describe\N what we're being forced to feel.{We're being forced to feel it,\N instead of being told in words.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:41.22,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,The current Earth government \Ndoesn't want to understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:45.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,They can only see the reality right before their eyes…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:50.62,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,…to survive and protect the Earth's sovereignty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:55.54,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,But wouldn't that lead to the wrong future ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:18:58.40,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:04.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm too embarrassed\N to pay respect to the deceased !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:11.00,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Only the Yamato crew has received Teresa’s message.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.16,0:19:17.00,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I want to go to Telezart !\NWill you help me ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:30.18,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:32.68,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,There's no place for the Yamato on today's Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.52,0:19:37.60,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{dakara}That's why we must find out the truth\N to stop this mistaken future from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:42.23,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{sorekoso}That's exactly what we must do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.23,0:19:45.46,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's the destiny of those who survived on the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.32,0:19:48.34,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Mr. Sanada…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:53.74,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,I’m sure Captain Okita will guide us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:54.92,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,That’s right. Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:55.34,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:19:56.13,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Let’s go on the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.16,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\pos(966,986)}Let's do it ! {girl: I’ll do my best.}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.16,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I'll do my best !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.16,0:19:58.94,def2,ENOMOTO,0,0,0,,We're not wrong !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:19:59.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Screw HQ. {girl: I’ll contact everyone.}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:01.46,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,I'll contact everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.96,0:20:29.74,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Nagakura, have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.43,0:20:30.98,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:56.18,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,We're going to be busy. \NI'll have to go get some extra clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:21:00.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki, I want you to hide somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:03.98,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,What do you mean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:09.23,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,This trip is different from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.23,0:21:12.90,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,What we're doing is treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.24,0:21:16.33,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,So, what ? \NYou just want me to stay on Earth ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.33,0:21:19.14,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Why do you treat me \Ndifferent from everyone else ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:20.90,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:26.60,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Is it because I didn't see the vision,\N or because Telezart didn't call me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:33.33,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I lost my memory because of the accident, \Nso I can only recall things from the last four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:35.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I don't want to drag you into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.92,0:21:47.22,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{After all, }We really don't know anything about each other, do we ?{don't we}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.34,0:21:51.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:54.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I’ll come home, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.32,0:21:57.34,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.74,0:22:09.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.38,0:22:43.97,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(212,874)}Episode 3
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.38,0:22:43.97,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(422,1042)}Astonishing Legacy of the Cosmo Reverse
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:23:05.20,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Tawamureru yuragu tsuki no kagami
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:23:05.20,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}The reflection of the moon is blurry and capricious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.78,0:23:17.20,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kokoro tokasu yuubina kami no itazura
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.78,0:23:17.20,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Graceful God's mischief mesmerizes my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:28.66,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchi ni himeta awai omoide ni
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:28.66,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}There's a faint memory hidden within{inside}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:41.14,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Iki wo fukikomu no michite yukumade
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:41.14,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Breathe life into it until it's full
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.14,0:23:52.92,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Hibiku anata no mune no kodou wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.14,0:23:52.92,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I hear a heartbeat echoing through
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:24:03.08,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Watashi hitori janai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:24:03.08,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I am not alone
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.34,0:24:14.98,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Saewataru sora ni inori
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.34,0:24:14.98,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I pray to the wide open sky
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.74,0:24:39.00,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Atarashii ichinichi no maku ga aketeyuku
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.74,0:24:39.00,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}The curtain opens on a brand new day
