Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.13,0:23:13.98,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1248,144)}Touchi Hiroki \NAmagai Kazusa\NHashi Takaya\NSugao Takayuki\NIshizuka Unsho\NKojima Toshihiko\NTerasoma Masaki\NKamiya Hiroshi\NKawai Tomoya\NInoue Kikuko\NFukumatsu Shinya\NYano Masaaki \NKitagawa Rina \NAoki Shiki
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.13,0:24:55.58,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.72,0:24:58.44,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I’m afraid of myself for resorting\N to using the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.44,0:25:01.14,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Is this the only option left ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.14,0:25:02.34,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,I won't allow any killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.34,0:25:04.24,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,We must launch the Yamato no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.24,0:25:06.74,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,Kodai, show your resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.90,0:25:08.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yamato, take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.63,0:25:09.13,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 04
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.63,0:25:09.13,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(956,678)}Take off for the Unknown!

